# Workflow

This project uses **`AGENTS.md`** (in the repository root) as the single
source of truth for all AI agents. Read it in full before doing any work.

For pre-flight, read only:

- `.workflow/status.yml` — Hekate switch/module allowlist, initialization
  status, and resolved feature flags

Apply `status.yml → hekate` first. If `hekate.enabled` is false, stop applying
Hekate rules. Run workflow, history, native-subagent, and orchestration behavior
unless its corresponding `hekate.modules` value is explicitly false. Missing
switches mean enabled for compatibility with older installations.

Lazy-load the detailed `.workflow/*.yml` files only when the current task needs
stack, architecture, conventions, full workflow rules, or preset definitions.

## Blocking

When the workflow module is enabled, if `status.yml → initialized` is not `true`, `active_preset` is `null`, or any
`checks.*` value is not `true` — **do not start work**. Run or refresh the
*Bootstrap* procedure from `.workflow/bootstrap.md`: analyze the project, fill
out YAML drafts, get user confirmation, and update `.workflow/status.yml`.

## Task cycle

Unless `hekate.modules.workflow` is false, the required stages depend on the active preset in
`status.yml → active_preset`. Respect the flags in `status.yml → features`:
only stages whose feature is enabled are mandatory.

Typical full cycle: **Analyze → Options (≥2, with pros/cons) → Plan
(self-contained; in `.workflow/history/` when history is enabled) → Execute →
Verify**.

If `status.yml → features.light_tdd: true`, apply light TDD for
non-trivial behavior changes. Default mode is `strict-lite`: add or update a
focused test first unless there is a clear, explicitly stated reason not to.

If `status.yml → features.granular_commits` is enabled and the task is large,
the plan must include a checkpoint checklist. Store it in `.workflow/history/`
only when the history module is enabled. After
each verified checkpoint, lazy-load `.workflow/workflow.yml` if the exact
granular-commit mode is needed.

Details are in section 3 of `AGENTS.md`.

## History

Unless `hekate.modules.history` is false:

- `.workflow/history/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` per task;
- `.workflow/history/events.jsonl` — a structured event log.

## Scope

Don't do unrequested refactors, don't add dependencies without
discussion, and perform destructive actions only with explicit
confirmation.
